<title>UK: Williams has 75.5 pct of Chubb.</title>
<headline>Williams has 75.5 pct of Chubb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Williams Holdings Plc said on Monday it had about 75.5 percent of Chubb Security Plc's shares under its agreed 1.3 billion stg bid for Chubb.</p>
<p>Williams, declaring its offer wholly unconditional, said it had received valid acceptances covering about 213.5 million Chubb shares.</p>
<p>Earlier, Britain's Department of Trade and Industry cleared the merger, which would unite major brand names in the world security industry. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
